@baseUrl = https://localhost:5500
@accessToken = replace-with-current-access-token

### Current invitation permission
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Administrator creates an expiring single-use invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account/invite-code
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Anonymous search must return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?text=private

### Search includes only the current reader's shelf names
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?text=private
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
